t[8635]={c="The battles of ages past are seeds from which legends grow. Yours is a time of heroes, young one. May your legend take root, thrive.$B$BI bid you well, $N, and offer you this token..."}
t[8636]={c="The stuff of life is doomed to die and return to the earth, but the stuff of spirit lives eternal.  I bid you well, $N, and offer you this token..."}
