t[8819]={c="Excellent!  It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately.  It's adventurers like you, $N, that truly make a difference.$B$BLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged.",p="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty.  For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Darnassus.  I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition.  We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.$B$BWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set."}
