t[9063]={c="You have traveled far to meet with me, $c, and not a moment too soon.",d="A hunter by the name of Torwa Pathfinder has requested the help of a druid.  He said only we would possess the necessary skills and respect for nature to help him.$b$bThere is a road that connects the Un'Goro Crater and the desert of Tanaris.  As that road enters the crater, you will find Torwa close by.",o="Speak with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater."}
t[9065]={d="$Tpunk;!  Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em.",o="Kill Kobold Vermin, 2 of em."}
t[9068]={c="Exellent $N !$B , you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Tunic.",d="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?$B$BThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.$B$BBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.$B$BSearch Naxxramas.",o="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!"}
