t[97180]={o="Take the Arcanite Barding to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep for inspection."}
t[97182]={o="Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands may be able to provide such a feed. Travel to the Dire Maul in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed to soothe it. Lastly, give it the Arcanite Barding and hope that it is willing to provide the needed blessing."}
